{"seq":1,"slug":"prefetching-preloading","title":"预取与预加载策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/prefetching-preloading","wordCount":1143,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"预取与预加载策略\">预取与预加载策略</h1><p>预取（prefetch）的核心命题是：如果我们能预测用户接下来需要什么数据，就可以在用户操作之前完成数据获取——将感知延迟从&quot;网络往返时间&quot;降至零。这不是魔法，而是用带宽换延迟的权衡决策。关键在于预测的准确率与浪费的请求数之间找到平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三级预取时机</strong>：路由级（高准确率）→ 交互级（鼠标悬停 200-500ms 窗口）→ 视口级（进入可见区域），从粗到细覆盖不同场景</li>\n<li><strong>ensureQueryData vs prefetchQuery</strong>：前者有新鲜缓存时不发请求（路由 loader 首选），后者总是触发后台请求</li>\n<li><strong>预取预算模型</strong>：只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{click} \\times T_{saved} &gt; C_{request}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的候选者才值得预取——避免浪费带宽和服务端资源</li>\n<li><strong>网络感知降级</strong>：通过 <code>navigator.connection</code> 检测慢网络或流量受限用户，自动禁用预取避免浪费有限带宽</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"预取的三个时机层级\">预取的三个时机层级</h2><p>预取可以在不同粒度上执行，从粗到细分为三个层级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>预测准确率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路由级</td>\n<td>路由匹配时</td>\n<td>高（用户已表达导航意图）</td>\n<td>页面核心数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互级</td>\n<td>鼠标悬停/焦点</td>\n<td>中高（200-500ms 预判窗口）</td>\n<td>详情页、弹窗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视口级</td>\n<td>元素进入视口</td>\n<td>中等（可见 ≠ 将点击）</td>\n<td>列表项详情、图片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[路由级预取] --&gt;|准确率高| B[页面首屏数据]&#10;    C[交互级预取] --&gt;|中等准确率| D[hover 预加载]&#10;    E[视口级预取] --&gt;|低准确率| F[列表项数据]&#10;&#10;    A --&gt;|触发时机| G[路由解析时]&#10;    C --&gt;|触发时机| H[鼠标进入/focus]&#10;    E --&gt;|触发时机| I[IntersectionObserver]\">flowchart LR\n    A[路由级预取] --&gt;|准确率高| B[页面首屏数据]\n    C[交互级预取] --&gt;|中等准确率| D[hover 预加载]\n    E[视口级预取] --&gt;|低准确率| F[列表项数据]\n\n    A --&gt;|触发时机| G[路由解析时]\n    C --&gt;|触发时机| H[鼠标进入/focus]\n    E --&gt;|触发时机| I[IntersectionObserver]</pre><h2 id=\"路由级预取\">路由级预取</h2><p>路由级预取在路由解析阶段就开始加载目标页面的数据。React Router v6+ 的 <code>loader</code> 机制天然支持这一模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { queryClient } from &#39;./queryClient&#39;&#10;import { userQueries, projectQueries } from &#39;./queries&#39;&#10;&#10;const router = createBrowserRouter([&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;/projects/:projectId&#39;,&#10;    loader: async ({ params }) =&gt; {&#10;      // 并行预取页面所需的所有数据&#10;      await Promise.all([&#10;        queryClient.ensureQueryData(projectQueries.detail(params.projectId!)),&#10;        queryClient.ensureQueryData(projectQueries.members(params.projectId!)),&#10;      ])&#10;      return null&#10;    },&#10;    element: &lt;ProjectPage /&gt;,&#10;  },&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { queryClient } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './queryClient'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { userQueries, projectQueries } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './queries'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> router</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createBrowserRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/projects/:projectId'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    loader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 并行预取页面所需的所有数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ensureQueryData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">detail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.projectId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ensureQueryData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectQueries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">members</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.projectId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    element: &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProjectPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ensureQueryData</code> 与 <code>prefetchQuery</code> 的区别：前者在缓存中有新鲜数据时直接返回（不发请求），后者总是触发后台请求。路由 loader 中应使用 <code>ensureQueryData</code> 避免不必要的请求。</p>\n<p>对于 Next.js App Router，预取通过 <code>&lt;Link&gt;</code> 组件自动完成——当链接进入视口时，Next.js 会预取目标路由的 RSC payload。客户端数据则需要手动预取：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Next.js 中配合 TanStack Query 的路由级预取&#10;&#39;use client&#39;&#10;import { useRouter } from &#39;next/navigation&#39;&#10;&#10;const PrefetchLink = ({ href, queryOptions, children }) =&gt; {&#10;  const router = useRouter()&#10;&#10;  const handleMouseEnter = () =&gt; {&#10;    router.prefetch(href)  // 预取路由&#10;    queryClient.prefetchQuery(queryOptions)  // 预取数据&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Link href={href} onMouseEnter={handleMouseEnter}&gt;&#10;      {children}&#10;    &lt;/Link&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Next.js 中配合 TanStack Query 的路由级预取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useRouter } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/navigation'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrefetchLink</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> router</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleMouseEnter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    router.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prefetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(href)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预取路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queryClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prefetchQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryOptions)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预取数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Link href</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{href} onMouseEnter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleMouseEnter}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Link</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"交互级预取\">交互级预取</h2><p>鼠标悬停到点击之间通常有 200-500ms 的间隔——足以完成大多数 API 请求。利用这个窗口预取是投入产出比最高的策略之一：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 通用的悬停预取 hook&#10;const usePrefetchOnHover = (queryOptions: QueryOptions) =&gt; {&#10;  const queryClient = useQueryClient()&#10;  const prefetched = useRef(false)&#10;&#10;  const handlers = {&#10;    onMouseEnter: () =&gt; {&#10;      if (!prefetched.current) {&#10;        queryClient.prefetchQuery(queryOptions)&#10;        prefetched.current = true&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    onFocus: () =&gt; {&#10;      if (!prefetched.current) {&#10;        queryClient.prefetchQuery(queryOptions)&#10;        prefetched.current = true&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return handlers&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用&#10;const UserCard = ({ user }: { user: UserSummary }) =&gt; {&#10;  const hoverProps = usePrefetchOnHover(userQueries.detail(user.id))&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Link to={`/users/${user.id}`} {...hoverProps}&gt;&#10;      {user.name}&#10;    &lt;/Link&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通用的悬停预取 hook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> usePrefetchOnHover</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D7