pan></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{click}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户实际点击的概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{saved}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是预取节省的加载时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{request}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是请求的代价（带宽 + 服务端处理时间）。只有预取价值为正的候选者才值得执行。</p>\n<p>实践中的启发式规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>当前页面的主导航项（tab/侧边栏）：总是预取</li>\n<li>列表中排名靠前的项：预取前 3-5 项的详情</li>\n<li>鼠标悬停的元素：几乎总是值得预取</li>\n<li>视口内但未交互的元素：仅在宽带充足时预取</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与请求瀑布流的关系\">与请求瀑布流的关系</h2><p>预取是消除请求瀑布流的关键工具之一。当页面数据存在层级依赖时，传统做法是串行获取：路由解析 → 布局数据 → 页面数据 → 子组件数据。通过在路由级并行预取所有已知数据需求，可以将瀑布流&quot;拍平&quot;为单层并行请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>预取是&quot;用带宽换延迟&quot;的架构决策——关键在于预测准确率足够高时才值得执行。路由级预取几乎总是正确的，交互级预取（hover）是投入产出比最高的策略，视口级预取需要结合网络条件谨慎使用。详细的瀑布流识别和消除技术见<a href=\"request-waterfall-optimization\">请求瀑布流优化</a>——预取在其中扮演的是&quot;提前触发&quot;的角色，而瀑布流优化还涉及请求提升、并行化和流式渲染等更系统性的策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预取与预加载策略","id":"预取与预加载策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预取的三个时机层级","id":"预取的三个时机层级"},{"level":2,"text":"路由级预取","id":"路由级预取"},{"level":2,"text":"交互级预取","id":"交互级预取"},{"level":2,"text":"视口级预取","id":"视口级预取"},{"level":2,"text":"预取的代价与权衡","id":"预取的代价与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"预取预算模型","id":"预取预算模型"},{"level":2,"text":"与请求瀑布流的关系","id":"与请求瀑布流的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时订阅与 WebSocket 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/advanced-patterns/realtime-subscriptions"},"next":{"title":"请求瀑布流优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/architecture/request-waterfall-optimization"}}